      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752710400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE MECHANISM MATCH\n\nKafka partition = sequential log append — write throughput bounded by disk sequential I/O, no coupling to consumer speed.\nElasticsearch write path = bounded thread pool contending with segment merges. A log between them turns uncontrolled\npush (every client writes whenever it wants) into controlled pull (fixed worker pool drains at its own pace).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE MECHANISM MATCH\n\nKafka partition = sequential log append — write throughput bounded by disk sequential I/O, no coupling to consumer speed.\nElasticsearch write path = bounded thread pool contending with segment merges. A log between them turns uncontrolled\npush (every client writes whenever it wants) into controlled pull (fixed worker pool drains at its own pace).",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
