      "locked": false,
      "text": "The tradeoff didn't disappear — it moved. A write isn't searchable until it clears the topic and a worker picks it up.\nConsumer lag is the metric you now watch instead of the crash you used to see instantly. Backfill Service handles\nschema/reindex jobs (10s–100s of TB) on its own throttled path, off the live traffic route.",
